<title>UK: Acesita sets $150 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Acesita sets $150 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ACESITA SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY ***15.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD   *+470-480 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		*OVER FIVE-YEAR W/I</p>
<p>		***PUT ON 15.OCT.01</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 250	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.625</p>
<p> NOTES	EURO-144A</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
